    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "honestly i feel like im not even real anymore. like i just exist in this glow of the screen and nothing else matters. i look at my hands and they dont even feel like mine. i think i might just be a ghost in a machine or something. it feels so much easier to just... not be here.",
